      ["ty","(start with the time word) In the morning I drink coffee","Sawv ntxov kuv haus kav fes","sawv ntxov (morning) · haus (drink) · kav fes (coffee)","hauv","haus (drink) ends in the tone letter s; hauv, with v, means in."]
